  "note": "Delivered quadruped run-loop art (9 characters, 3072x768 sheets / 768x768 RGBA frames, F1-F4 loop). Source bytes are retained untouched under sourceRoot (directory/file names normalized to the ASCII runtime IDs below; pixel content is byte-identical to the delivered ZIP). tools/build_run_loop_art.mjs derives runtimeRoot from this source: (1) connected-component cleanup removes disconnected extraction-artifact alpha islands only (see cleanupFindings below), (2) a per-character union bbox crop+uniform resize keeps scale/ground-line consistent across F1-F4, (3) P2 palette is derived via the existing applyP2Palette()/P2_PROFILES pipeline from tools/build_current_art.mjs (no ad-hoc recolor). Battle Gyuiin RENDA (stepRenda/BAL.MINIGAME.RENDA) is unrelated and untouched -- this art is wired only into standalone MINIGAME RENDA (#102).",
